.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
benchmarking the \fBFiniteVolumeStencil\fP container class underpinning CSMP's transport schemes\&. 

Compares the access speed of \fBFiniteVolumeStencil\fP with a refactored version based on \fBDynamicArray2D\fP and \fBDynamicArray3D\fP

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
a tetrahedral / triangular element mesh is used to to keep variable access cost to a mininum 
.RE
.PP

.SH "Member Function Documentation"
